  nameEnglish: Diluted Shot
  descriptionEnglish: Increases the number of bullets fired by 1, but reduces the
    weapon's base damage by 25%. Additional runes reduce damage by 10%. Bullets spread
    upon leaving the barrel. Does not affect ammo consumption.
  nameChinese: Diluted Shot
  descriptionChinese: "\u5B50\u5F39\u53D1\u5C04\u6570\u91CF\u589E\u52A01\u53D1\uFF0C\u4F46\u6B66\u5668\u57FA\u7840\u4F24\u5BB3\u964D\u4F4E25%\u3002\u989D\u5916\u7684\u7B26\u6587\u4F1A\u4F7F\u4F24\u5BB3\u518D\u964D\u4F4E10%\u3002\u5B50\u5F39\u51FA\u819B\u65F6\u4F1A\u6563\u5C04\u3002\u4E0D\u5F71\u54CD\u5F39\u836F\u6D88\u8017\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Diluted Shot
  descriptionPortuguese: "Aumenta em 1 o n\xFAmero de balas disparadas, mas diminui
    o dano base da arma em 25%. Runas adicionais diminuem o dano em 10%. Balas se
    dispersam ao sair do cano. N\xE3o altera o consumo de muni\xE7\xE3o."
  nameSpanish: Diluted Shot
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Aumenta en 1 el n\xFAmero de balas disparadas, pero
    reduce el da\xF1o base del arma en un 25%. Las runas adicionales reducen el da\xF1o
    en un 10%. Las balas se dispersan al salir del ca\xF1\xF3n. No altera el consumo
    de munici\xF3n."
